    "preamble": "M/S Hetha Organics L.L.P. vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 26 November, 2025 Author: Arun Kumar Bench: Arun Kumar High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad Neutral Citation No. - 2025:Ahc:212241 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad Writ - C No. - 40591 of 2025 M/S Hetha Organics L.L.P. .....Petitioner(s) Versus State Of U.P. And 2 Others .....Respondent(s) Counsel for Petitioner(s) : Dushyant Singh, Mahesh Chand M/S Hetha Organics L.L.P. vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 26 November, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/164432657/ 1 Counsel for Respondent(s) : C.S.C. Court No. - 9",
    "facts": "The present petition has been filed challenging the impugned recovery certificate, dated 4.6.2025 issued against the petitioner in pursuance of the order of the Additional District Magistrate (City), Ghaziabad/Adjudicating Authority, passed under Section 51 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3. Learned Standing Counsel at the outset has stated that against the order of the Adjudicating Authority, dated 10.2.2025, the petitioner has already filed an appeal before the Food Safety and Standards Tribunal, Meerut, under Section 70 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. In the said appeal an application for grant of interim order has also been filed.",
